Redirect 301 /mac-help https://github.com/daylen/Jellyfish-mac/wiki/User-Guide
Redirect 301 /mac/user-guide https://github.com/daylen/Jellyfish-mac/wiki/User-Guide

AddType text/html .shtml
AddHandler server-parsed .html
AddHandler server-parsed .shtml
Options Indexes FollowSymLinks Includes

RewriteEngine on
RewriteCond %{http_host} ^Jellyfishchess.com [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ http://Jellyfishchess.org/$1 [R=301,NC,L]
RewriteCond %{http_host} ^www.Jellyfishchess.com [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ http://Jellyfishchess.org/$1 [R=301,NC,L]
RewriteCond %{http_host} ^Jellyfish.io [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ http://Jellyfishchess.org/$1 [R=301,NC,L]
RewriteCond %{http_host} ^www.Jellyfish.io [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ http://Jellyfishchess.org/$1 [R=301,NC,L]
RewriteCond %{http_host} ^www.Jellyfishchess.org [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ http://Jellyfishchess.org/$1 [R=301,NC,L]